        }
      ],
      "returnType": "template<OtherDerived> EIGEN_DEVICE_FUNC EIGEN_STRONG_INLINE Derived&",
      "docs": "\\internal Like _set() but additionally makes the assumption that no aliasing effect can happen (which\nis the case when creating a new matrix) so one can enforce lazy evaluation.\n\\sa operator=(const MatrixBase<OtherDerived>&), _set()"
